msgctxt ",AFD09BB54E770A9D431D899E000ED00C"
msgid "전투 종료 시 체력을 12 회복"
msgstr "Restore 12 HP at the end of combat"

#. Key:	6FA5E6D142D162DA4386459C0BF4F57C
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_EndTurn_025HP_GetDefense_4.DA_Passive_EndTurn_025HP_GetDefense_4.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_EndTurn_025HP_GetDefense_4.DA_Passive_EndTurn_025HP_GetDefense_4.mDescription
msgctxt ",6FA5E6D142D162DA4386459C0BF4F57C"
msgid "턴 종료 시 체력이 25% 이하라면 방어도 4 획득"
msgstr "Gain 4 Defense at the end of your turn if your HP is at or below 25%."

#. Key:	F06ECCE64F97371B36A970A7B99349C3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P001.DA_Passive_P001.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P001.DA_Passive_P001.mDescription
msgctxt ",F06ECCE64F97371B36A970A7B99349C3"
msgid "전투 시작 시, 전투 종료까지 자신의 회복 효과가 25% 증가합니다."
msgstr "At the start of combat, increase your healing effects by 25% until combat ends."

#. Key:	F0D8C789473E5207815A678C837A1EDC
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P002.DA_Passive_P002.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P002.DA_Passive_P002.mDescription
msgctxt ",F0D8C789473E5207815A678C837A1EDC"
msgid "전투 시작 시, 자신에게 신속 3을 부여합니다."
msgstr "Gain 3 Haste at the start of combat."

#. Key:	205E08C44989DD82BC70D0B2FF9D59AA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P003.DA_Passive_P003.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P003.DA_Passive_P003.mDescription
msgctxt ",205E08C44989DD82BC70D0B2FF9D59AA"
msgid "턴 종료 시, 자신의 체력이 50% 이하라면 자신에게 방어도 4를 부여합니다."
msgstr "At the end of your turn, gain 4 Defense if your HP is at or below 50%."

#. Key:	FCDF23B5454899A2B3587595E05F703D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P004.DA_Passive_P004.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P004.DA_Passive_P004.mDescription
msgctxt ",FCDF23B5454899A2B3587595E05F703D"
msgid "턴 시작 시, 5회 째라면 AP 3을 획득합니다."
msgstr "Gain 3 AP at the start of your 5th turn."

#. Key:	47A82660400B434A57BCB6A4A1997158
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P005.DA_Passive_P005.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P005.DA_Passive_P005.mDescription
msgctxt ",47A82660400B434A57BCB6A4A1997158"
msgid "스킬 사용 시, 10회 째 사용할 때마다 AP 3을 획득합니다."
msgstr "Gain 3 AP on every 10th skill use."

#. Key:	638EE6CA43AEDDF7B6E85CB571337F70
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P006.DA_Passive_P006.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P006.DA_Passive_P006.mDescription
msgctxt ",638EE6CA43AEDDF7B6E85CB571337F70"
msgid "전투 종료 시, 체력을 5 회복합니다."
msgstr "Restore 5 HP at the end of combat."

#. Key:	CAAE21E74B6E69C4DF905194698AB6A5
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P007.DA_Passive_P007.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P007.DA_Passive_P007.mDescription
msgctxt ",CAAE21E74B6E69C4DF905194698AB6A5"
msgid "스킬 사용 시, 3회 째 사용할 때마다 공격력이 50% 증가합니다."
msgstr "Every 3rd skill use increases attack power by 50%."

#. Key:	07CF45084D47C668C07A08B4EA55C2A1
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P008.DA_Passive_P008.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P008.DA_Passive_P008.mDescription
msgctxt ",07CF45084D47C668C07A08B4EA55C2A1"
msgid "스킬 사용 시, 5회 째 사용할 때마다 자신에게 예리함 5을 부여합니다."
msgstr "Gain 5 Acuity on every 5th skill use."

#. Key:	8647A6E14B779EB6686E688A61BB97DE
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P009.DA_Passive_P009.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P009.DA_Passive_P009.mDescription
msgctxt ",8647A6E14B779EB6686E688A61BB97DE"
msgid "턴 종료 시, 남은 AP만큼 자신에게 방어도를 부여합니다."
msgstr "At the end of your turn, gain Defense equal to your remaining AP."

#. Key:	4F022F5E4F645AC5921504AB2E7617DA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P010.DA_Passive_P010.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P010.DA_Passive_P010.mDescription
msgctxt ",4F022F5E4F645AC5921504AB2E7617DA"
msgid "첫 턴 시작 시, AP 3을 획득합니다."
msgstr "Gain 3 AP at the start of your first turn."

#. Key:	D70222204EA2E1E29489368DAD5809F9
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P011.DA_Passive_P011.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P011.DA_Passive_P011.mDescription
msgctxt ",D70222204EA2E1E29489368DAD5809F9"
msgid "턴 시작 시 체력이 50% 이상일 때, 자신에게 예리함 20을 부여합니다.(턴 종료 시 제거)"
msgstr "If your HP is at or above 50% at the start of your turn, gain 20 Acuity. (Removed at the end of the turn.)"

#. Key:	353099954EB3F3406C80DEB536902521
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P012.DA_Passive_P012.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P012.DA_Passive_P012.mDescription
msgctxt ",353099954EB3F3406C80DEB536902521"
msgid "턴 시작 시 체력이 50% 이하일 때, 자신에게 근력 3를 부여합니다. (턴 종료 시 제거)"
msgstr "If your HP is at or below 50% at the start of your turn, gain 3 Strength. (Removed at the end of the turn.)"

#. Key:	A99041724CA6EB7D35BEDBB0C685F68D
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P013.DA_Passive_P013.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P013.DA_Passive_P013.mDescription
msgctxt ",A99041724CA6EB7D35BEDBB0C685F68D"
msgid "전투 종료 시, 최대 체력이 1 증가합니다."
msgstr "Increase maximum HP by 1 at the end of combat."

#. Key:	F7F1384B4B6CEDC1DC5BA793C5B5CF87
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P014.DA_Passive_P014.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P014.DA_Passive_P014.mDescription
msgctxt ",F7F1384B4B6CEDC1DC5BA793C5B5CF87"
msgid "스킬 사용 시, 체력을 잃으면, 자신에게 근력 1을 부여합니다."
msgstr "If you lose HP while using a skill, gain 1 Strength."

#. Key:	3C2A282A411BA5229D9816999982625A
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P015.DA_Passive_P015.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P015.DA_Passive_P015.mDescription
msgctxt ",3C2A282A411BA5229D9816999982625A"
msgid "스킬 사용 시 중독을 부여한다면, 대상에게 중독 1을 추가로 부여합니다."
msgstr "When a skill inflicts Poison, inflict 1 additional Poison on the target."

#. Key:	5B0EC442489DA8D2B9B99D9C0C64CAA3
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P018.DA_Passive_P018.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P018.DA_Passive_P018.mDescription
msgctxt ",5B0EC442489DA8D2B9B99D9C0C64CAA3"
msgid "효과 적용 종료 시, 대상의 체력이 0이하가 되었다면, 체력을 10 회복합니다."
msgstr "After applying an effect, restore 10 HP if the target's HP reaches 0 or below."

#. Key:	F90CB4B94D0782E7398FD3878EE2A156
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P019.DA_Passive_P019.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P019.DA_Passive_P019.mDescription
msgctxt ",F90CB4B94D0782E7398FD3878EE2A156"
msgid "효과 적용 종료 시, 대상의 체력이 0이하가 되었다면, AP 3과 SP 3을 획득합니다."
msgstr "After applying an effect, gain 3 AP and 3 SP if the target's HP reaches 0 or below."

#. Key:	9108D7C94A84A09BEC1C7CB9E5EAA3BA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P020.DA_Passive_P020.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P020.DA_Passive_P020.mDescription
msgctxt ",9108D7C94A84A09BEC1C7CB9E5EAA3BA"
msgid "전투 시작 시, 자신에게 근력 2를 부여합니다."
msgstr "Gain 2 Strength at the start of combat."

#. Key:	CFF0B2B04D042F5C7E23779B13162ADB
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P021.DA_Passive_P021.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P021.DA_Passive_P021.mDescription
msgctxt ",CFF0B2B04D042F5C7E23779B13162ADB"
msgid "전투 시작 시, SP 3을 획득합니다."
msgstr "Gain 3 SP at the start of combat."

#. Key:	75ACFA2D4B76840CFD4792B6F69EA2BD
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P022.DA_Passive_P022.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P022.DA_Passive_P022.mDescription
msgctxt ",75ACFA2D4B76840CFD4792B6F69EA2BD"
msgid "전투 시작 시, 자신에게 예리함 10을 부여합니다."
msgstr "Gain 10 Acuity at the start of combat."

#. Key:	9E77F77644EA23F0F743228B002275AA
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P023.DA_Passive_P023.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P023.DA_Passive_P023.mDescription
msgctxt ",9E77F77644EA23F0F743228B002275AA"
msgid "효과 피격 전, 대상 적군의 공격 피해량이 1 감소된 상태에서 피격됩니다."
msgstr "Before taking a hit, reduce the target enemy's attack damage by 1."

#. Key:	742BFF3A4134D49E0EDEEF8590217DA2
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P024.DA_Passive_P024.mDescription
#: /Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P024.DA_Passive_P024.mDescription
msgctxt ",742BFF3A4134D49E0EDEEF8590217DA2"
msgid "스킬 사용 시, 자신에게 방어도 1을 부여합니다."
msgstr "Gain 1 Defense when you use a skill."

#. Key:	908DA5564E07294F77DD73AC007EF1B4
#. SourceLocation:	/Game/BP/DataAsset/Passive/DA_Passive_P025.DA_Passive_P025.mDescription
