msgid "왼쪽부터 행동할 차례입니다.\nR은 라운드 번호이며, 화살표로 이후 순서를 볼 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Units act in order from the left.\nR is the round number. Use the arrows to view later turns."

#. Key:	ActionPoints
#. SourceLocation:	Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(68)
#: Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(68)
msgctxt "FieldGuide,ActionPoints"
msgid "AP는 행동에 쓰는 자원입니다.\n이동과 스킬에 필요한 AP를 확인하고 사용하세요."
msgstr "AP is the resource used for actions.\nCheck the AP cost of movement and skills before using them."

#. Key:	Condition
#. SourceLocation:	Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(70)
#: Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(70)
msgctxt "FieldGuide,Condition"
msgid "표정은 컨디션입니다.\n나쁨·보통·좋음 순으로 피해가 높아지며, 최상은 치명타도 적용됩니다."
msgstr "The face shows condition.\nDamage increases from Bad to Normal to Good. Excellent also grants a critical hit."

#. Key:	StatusIcons
#. SourceLocation:	Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(72)
#: Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(72)
msgctxt "FieldGuide,StatusIcons"
msgid "상태이상이 생기면 요약판에 아이콘이 표시됩니다.\n아이콘을 누르면 효과를 확인할 수 있습니다."
msgstr "Status effect icons appear on the summary panel.\nTap an icon to see its effect."

#. Key:	MercenaryStats
#. SourceLocation:	Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(74)
#: Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(74)
msgctxt "FieldGuide,MercenaryStats"
msgid "HP는 남은 체력, AP는 행동 자원입니다.\n속도는 행동 순서에 영향을 줍니다."
msgstr "HP is your remaining health, and AP is your action resource.\nSpeed affects turn order."

#. Key:	SkillCost
#. SourceLocation:	Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(76)
#: Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(76)
