msgstr "This is the AP required to use the skill.\nYou cannot use it if you do not have enough AP."

#. Key:	SkillCooldown
#. SourceLocation:	Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(78)
#: Source/P_RD/UI/Tutorial/GuidedTutorialWidget.cpp(78)
